    "0.0.6": {
        "info": {
            "author": "Iuri Torres & Jo\u00e3o Witor",
            "author_email": "iuri.t1000@gmail.com",
            "bugtrack_url": null,
            "classifiers": [],
            "description": "# WIU Python Library\r\n\r\n## Usage\r\n- import\r\n\r\n```\r\nfrom wiu import Calculator as calc\r\n\r\nmult = calc.multiply(2, 3)\r\nprint(mult)\r\n```\r\n\r\nreturns:\r\n> 6\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n- Basic operations\r\n```\r\nadd = calc.add(2, 3)\r\nsub = calc.subtract(2, 3)\r\nmult = calc.multiply(2, 3)\r\ndiv = calc.divide(2, 3)\r\n\r\nprint(add, sub, mult, div)\r\n```\r\nreturns:\r\n> 5 -1 6 0.6666666666666666\r\n\r\n- Product of many numbers\r\n```\r\nmy_numbers = [1, 3, 6, 4, 5, 9]\r\n\r\nprod = calc.product(my_numbers)\r\nprint(prod)\r\n```\r\nreturns:\r\n> 3240\r\n\r\n- Factorial\r\n```\r\nfact = calc.factorial(6)\r\nprint(fact)\r\n```\r\nreturns:\r\n> 720\r\n\r\n",
